<view class="screen"><view class="page-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">GESTURE TRAINING</view><view class="page-title">{{isResampling ? '重新采样手势' : '记录当前手势'}}</view><view class="page-copy">{{isResampling ? '保存后原位替换旧模板，保留原 ID 和关联绑定。' : '做出动作，确认采样结果，再赋予它一段含义。'}}</view></view><status-badge tone="{{statusTone}}" text="{{connected ? '数据已连接' : '等待连接'}}" /></view><view class="card"><section-header title="1 · 做出手势" copy="保存时记录十路启用掩码；关闭通道不会参与该模板的识别。" /><view class="finger-grid"><finger-bar wx:for="{{fingers}}" wx:key="label" label="{{item.label}}" value="{{item.value}}" state="{{item.state}}" tone="{{item.tone}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" /></view><view class="metric-grid"><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Roll</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.roll}}</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Pitch</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.pitch}}</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Yaw</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.yaw}}</view></view></view></view><view class="card"><section-header title="2 · 命名与保存" copy="保存十指弯曲度、状态、当前启用掩码和 IMU 姿态。" /><view wx:if="{{isResampling}}" class="notice">正在替换「{{name}}」；其现有关联绑定会随原 ID 保留。</view><text class="field-label">手势名称</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：你好" value="{{name}}" bindinput="changeName" /><text class="field-label">对应文字 / 动作</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：你好，欢迎使用智能手语手套" value="{{action}}" bindinput="changeAction" /><text class="field-label">用途</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categoryOptions}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="changeCategory"><view class="input picker-value">{{categoryOptions[categoryIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="notice">{{statusText}}</view><button class="primary-button save" bindtap="save">{{isResampling ? '重新采样并替换原模板' : '保存当前手势'}}</button></view></view>
